.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBVirtualList\fR: a scrolling list of \fBfixed\-height rows\fR that builds only the rows in view. The flat list: no separators and no surface of its own. \fBResponsiveTable\fR and \fBTree\fR virtualize their own rows; this is the plain list.
.PP
The application keeps a \fBViewport\fR fed by \fBon_scroll\fR and passes it back; the list asks it for the window of rows to build and fills the rest with spacers, so the scroll bar stays true to the whole length.
.PP
.nf
.RS
VirtualList::new(self.tracks.len(), 48.0, &self.viewport, |i| track_row(&self.tracks[i]))
    .on_scroll(Msg::Scroll)       // Msg::Scroll(vp) => self.viewport = vp
    .overscan(4)
.RE
.fi
.PP
Rows have one height, so which rows show is arithmetic (\fBprimitives::virtualize\fR).
